message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Timing the Chaos: Temporal Sensor Desynchronization Attacks in Non-Lane-Based Traffic Systems"
abstract: >-
  A research study of temporal sensor desynchronization (desync) attacks on
  V2V position updates in non-lane-based traffic systems. Six attack scenarios
  are implemented in a modified DhakaSim microsimulator and validated across
  three topologies, with a DTW-based detector, a causal radar-discrepancy
  delay estimator, and velocity-compensated gap correction as defenses.
